WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:32.950
Lina, get back!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:33.890
Right!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.790
Joey!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:41.620
Right.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.880
Heroman...

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.680
Go!

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:05.350
Huh?

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.040
Joey, where's Heroman?

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.340
Heroman... Go!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.740
Go, go, go!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.240
He's not coming?

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:20.960
Doesn't look like it...

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.770
Here they come!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.440
Get over there!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.630
What about you, Joey?

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.910
Hurry up while I distract them!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.200
Right!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.300
We're counting on you!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.130
Over here!

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.670
Here!

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.680
That's right, come here!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.940
That'll do.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.470
Joey, nice work.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:29.510
Dr. Ravi, what's happening on this island?

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.450
Yeah...

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.650
I guess there's no point 
trying to hide it now.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:40.210
Just like you heard, this is an uninhabited 
island owned by the government.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:46.310
It's officially billed as an R&R spot for 
high-level personnel, but that's just a front.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.980
A branch of the military is using it for 
their own biological weapons research.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.960
Since it's an uninhabited island,

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.300
we were doing experiments that were way too 
dangerous to even think about normally.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.170
This monster is part of that research.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.180
Why were you doing something like that?

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.680
If the research was successful, we'd have 
a weapon more powerful than nukes!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:09.140
This plant has an incredible 
regeneration ability,

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.870
and can move in ways that are 
beyond our comprehension.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:17.250
Our research was to extract out that 
ability, and to make it useful for the military.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.950
The experiment went well.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.250
Or perhaps, too well.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.990
And that's when the accident happened.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:28.970
Yes, that's right.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:33.000
The regeneration jumped to 
unexpected levels, and...

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.490
...we became unable to control it.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:42.360
It may only be a few more hours until this 
entire island is covered in those vines!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.550
So we've got to head to the airstrip!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.390
Hurry and get off of the island!

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.450
What about everyone else?

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.620
Like Psy and Miss Collins...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:54.170
I think I said to head 
to the airstrip earlier.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.960
That's what they're doing, probably...

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.910
And what if they aren't?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.790
I'm sorry, but in that case...

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:04.360
I cannot run away and leave 
Heroman and the others behind!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.130
This isn't the time to be 
worrying about others!

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.880
We're up against an out-of-control 
military weapon!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:12.290
Is there a way to defeat those vines?

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.960
I won't run. I will fight!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.220
Tell me!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:27.200
The plant's energy source is probably the 
power generator in the research lab.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.550
If you can destroy the core 
that absorbs the energy,

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.580
then you should be able to stop the growth.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.470
The core?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.350
And where is that?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.960
Its roots are in the laboratory, 
and it's making a giant trunk.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.610
The crystal in the center is the core.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.450
Understood.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.610
Let's go, Lina.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:46.850
Right.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.880
Hey, I'll come too!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.120
So, what do you plan to do, Joey?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.940
First I'll find where Heroman is.

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.100
But, how?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.400
He didn't come when you 
called before, right?

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.750
We'll climb up to a place with 
a view of the entire island.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:08.310
Are you sure about this?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.910
About what?

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.350
About him...

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:17.220
I've heard that you fought the Skrugg, 
but this, um... Fantasticman...

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.550
<i>Hero</i>man!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.610
But Heroman isn't here...

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.850
Don't worry.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.940
How can you be so confident?

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.350
Because <i>Joey</i> is my hero.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.700
Hero, huh?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.450
Heroman, where did you go?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.770
I knew it... I'm nervous 
when you're not around.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:55.100
But I have to stay strong, or the 
other two will be even more scared.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.800
I've got to do my best...

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:03.350
Heroman, I don't know
what's happened to you.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:07.440
But, if you're in some sort of 
trouble, I'll do something about it.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.090
You can count on it!

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:18.150
Is someone there?

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:19.360
Miss Collins?

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:20.490
Psy?

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.450
What's that?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.460
Were you studying things other than plants?

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.720
That's just a crab.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.850
They're big, but they've 
always lived here...

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.340
They're related to hermit crabs.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:44.320
A crab...

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.850
Oh...

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:52.340
Shoot! I have to stay strong!

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:59.450
Hey, can't you hear something?

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.520
It's just another crab.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.630
Help...

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.590
See? That's a person's voice.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.330
Is someone there?

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:15.080
Help... Please...

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.230
Are you okay?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:16.840
No, wait!

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:18.890
Look carefully...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.720
That's not human.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:32.450
Come... here...

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.300
The vines are speaking?

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:38.830
The vines are rubbing together 
and mimicking human voice!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.080
Don't go!

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:40.080
Here it comes!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.130
Run!

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.640
What incredible learning ability!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.940
In such a short time, and 
without any vocal cords,

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.140
it's managed to mimic human voice! Amazing!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:02.290
If it continues to learn at this rate, 
it'll be beyond anyone's control!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.990
Don't talk like it's someone else's problem!

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.350
This is all because of...

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.430
Vines again?

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.880
No! That's Miss Collins's voice!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:17.060
Stop! No! You mustn't!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.200
You mustn't!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.450
Miss Collins!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.290
You mustn't!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:22.560
You mustn't!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.550
Are you okay?

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.580
No, I'm not okay!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.500
This is an island of giants!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.200
These crabs were always this big.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:34.340
They're bigger than the 
lobsters in Center City!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.700
My sandal!

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:37.800
Hey!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.760
I just bought them, and 
only used them this once!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:46.520
They're my favorite from this year's new
lineup, and they were really expensive...

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:50.400
Miss Collins... Have you seen 
Professor Denton or Psy?

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.400
No. I thought they were with you.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.860
Um, I'd like you to help us with something.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.660
We climbed all the way up here,

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.220
but you won't be able to 
see anything in the dark.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.920
Actually, dark will do perfectly.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.220
Heroman... Attack!

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:28.600
No use?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.320
There he is. Over there.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:36.900
You're right!

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.790
Finally found you.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.180
All right!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.150
Electricity?

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:47.900
I see. So that's it.

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.950
Is this the right way?

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.400
The light from before was 
over by the waterfall.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.130
Don't worry, we're on the right path.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:06.370
Heroman!

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.650
Heroman!

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:31.140
Heroman!

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.120
Heroman!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.700
Captain Hero has been...

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:46.180
It's Hero<i>man</i>!

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:47.960
We've got to save him!

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.290
But how?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:53.460
No matter how strong he is, he'll 
never break free of those vines.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.740
If power alone won't work...

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.740
Heroman... Blast!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.780
It's...

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.500
...absorbing the energy...

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:26.630
That attack is dangerous!

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:29.230
It's giving the thing energy!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:34.810
Able to stretch like a rubber band, 
and able to absorb energy...

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:37.530
Thanks to that, Heroman can't move.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.570
Everyone, stand back!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.870
Joey!

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.750
Leave this to him.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.490
What are you going to do?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.630
I'm going to save Heroman, no matter what!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:58.760
Ever since I met him, Heroman has been 
by my side, always there to save me...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.990
Always, always...

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:06.130
So, this time...

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.260
It's my turn!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.240
How?

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.020
How should I save him?

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:25.390
What should I do?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.530
I can only get close for a second.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:31.780
At this rate Heroman's energy 
will be completely absorbed!

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.540
That's it!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.790
Energy!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.330
Heroman...

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.420
Disengage!

00:13:51.870 --> 00:13:52.680
Joey!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.350
Guess that worked.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:01.170
You made him small.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:01.790
Yup.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.630
Hey!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.460
We've been looking everywhere.

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:07.990
Is everyone here?

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.780
Professor Denton, Psy!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.830
How did you know we were here?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:16.380
We figured that Heroman would end 
up cuttin' loose at some point.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:20.000
So we used the electric bolts 
from Heroman as a landmark.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.400
Thank goodness.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.000
I'm so glad everyone is safe.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.110
Yeah...

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:28.260
Okay, buddy! You've got 
some explaining to do!

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.760
Psy, I'll explain while we're 
heading to the research lab.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.800
Research lab?

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.820
So that's...

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:42.800
Yeah.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.270
It's the research lab where 
the thing's core is.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.900
It's crawling in vines...

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.070
Heroman and I will go.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.900
Everyone else, wait here.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.310
I'll come too.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.980
Only I can open the lock 
to the room with the core.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:02.020
And I feel like you guys might 
be able to pull it off...

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.610
Glad to have you with us.

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:05.680
Don't get separated.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.300
Understood.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.150
Be careful.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.650
Break a leg.

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:11.140
Right.

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:14.370
I'm counting on you, Heroman.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.570
Why aren't they attacking?

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.010
I don't know.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:28.640
Could it be a trap?

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:29.700
Impossible.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.150
These things shouldn't 
be that intelligent...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:54.220
Um, Mister Giant, you can get in this way...

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.150
His name is Heroman!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:15:59.400
Take a left up there.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.930
There's stairs farther in!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.700
Heroman, here!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.340
The stairs are this way.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.780
The elevator isn't going to work 
for someone as heavy as him.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.300
Who said we were taking the elevator?

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:18.340
But the power generator 
is in the tenth basement!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.490
Nice work...

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.270
I knew it! It's waiting for us!

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:51.660
This is...

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.420
Dr. Ravi, that's the core, right?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:17:00.190
Yes! The crystal shining in 
the center of the trunk!

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.040
Save me!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:08.920
What?

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.460
What the heck is that?

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.690
It copied Heroman?

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.110
That name of the demon is Shapeshifter.

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:40.000
Just as the name says, it 
can change its form at will.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.620
And it shows itself as the thing 
the people it curses fear the most.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.710
Shapeshifter...

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.220
Their movements are the same?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.550
Heroman, be careful!

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:17.590
If you get caught by those vines, 
you won't be able to move again!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.040
Now! Hit the crystal!

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.680
If we can destroy it...

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.700
It regenerated! And now there are three!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:47.680
Heroman!

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:09.410
Oh, no!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.930
Heroman...

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.850
Disengage!

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.530
Heroman... Engage!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.340
Go!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.980
Heroman... Finish!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.170
Did they do it?

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.540
They did it!

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:42.490
Looks like it.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:44.890
We're saved, somehow...

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.970
It's over...

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.800
This was one crazy vacation.

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:18.580
It's never a dull day around 
you, Joey, that's for sure.

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:20.290
Sorry...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:23.550
Hey, this isn't Joey's fault.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:28.050
And anyway, I never would have gotten 
to swim at such a wonderful beach.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.180
Yes, you are correct!

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:34.570
Looks like the government 
owes you guys even more now.

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.060
I'm really sorry.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:41.060
In two hours a helicopter 
should be here to pick us up.

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.810
Two hours?

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:46.030
Then I can go for another swim!

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:50.050
Miss Collins, wait for me!

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:54.960
Those vines...

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.310
Hey, Joey!

00:21:58.820 --> 00:21:59.810
Let's go!

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:02.250
Sure!

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:04.150
Hurry up!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:52.650
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:55.370
Sis, I'm begging you, stop!

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:57.250
What did you say?

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.010
Well, obviously.

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:00.450
Because you're a pain.

00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:02.910
Mysterious abductions begin 
happening one after another.

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:06.250
Soon, even Denton goes missing.

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:11.920
In order to solve the riddle, 
Joey, Psy, and Holly...

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:15.640
Next time on Heroman #20: Missing.

00:24:15.990 --> 00:24:18.950
Heroman... Attack!
